05,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":449}],"title":"Buy Murder Is Game Over: Murder Otaku"}],"packages":[1230905],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, 7, 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/AMD Quad-Core 2+ Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GT 400 / Radeon 6000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":25,"final":449,"final_formatted":"$4.49 USD","initial":599,"initial_formatted":"$5.99"},"publishers":["HitherYon Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"1 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe Murder is Game Over series keeps getting better and better and Murder is Game Over: Murder Otaku manages to show why the series has the following it does. If you like detective RPGs, that are on the shorter and more digestible side, then you should definitely give Murder is Game Over: Murder Otaku a try. And if you find yourself liking it, check out the rest of the Murder is Game Over series as well.\u201d<br>The Otaku Authority<br><br>\u201cOver the years, the Murder is Game Over series has grown to include new chapters, each one more intriguing than the last. It was very satisfying to solve the mystery and discover the culprit\u2019s identity (even before Detective Guy\u2019s explanation).\u201d<br>85% \u2013 1 Up Nerd<br><br>\u201cDetective Guy and Cleo are a charming and captivating pair, and are fast becoming a well-established murder-mystery-solving team. Each of the games in the Murder is Game Over series seems to offer something new and be made with a little more finesse, with the narrative design becoming more intricate and enthralling. This new instalment is no exception. The developers\u2019 hard work, dedication, and love for the characters and series shine through when playing all of the games, but perhaps become even more apparent with each new story.\u201d<br>Indie Hive<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/defbcb858c9a6e3d81243bccc87a503b35173092/ss_defbcb858c9a6e3d81243bccc87a503b35173092.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767193961","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/defbcb858c9a6e3d81243bccc87a503b35173092/ss_defbcb858c9a6e3d81243bccc87a503b35173092.600x338.jpg?t=1767193961"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/90e4c3726288bf2febd4cc8c46fa06379dd0c33c/ss_90e4c3726288bf2febd4cc8c46fa06379dd0c33c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767193961","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/90e4c3726288bf2febd4cc8c46fa06379dd0c33c/ss_90e4c3726288bf2febd4cc8c46fa06379dd0c33c.600x338.jpg?t=1767193961"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/ss_d87933b587ce308d65087acf2650e025201cf827.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767193961","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/ss_d87933b587ce308d65087acf2650e025201cf827.600x338.jpg?t=1767193961"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/ss_870187256d1e762c5b564eb83fd06ec3d0fa8e88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767193961","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34